msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:59
msgid "Suggested text: When you submit a contact form, we send the information and enabled file attachments you provide to FormSubmit.co to process and deliver your message by email. FormSubmit states that submissions are retained in its archive for 30 days. Our website and email provider may retain messages separately. Contact us for details about our retention policy. This plugin does not store submission records. Replace this text with a notice appropriate to your use."
msgstr ""

