msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:165
msgid "Privacy and service details"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:166
msgid "Enabling this action sends included field values, enabled attachments, the recipient address and the site home URL to FormSubmit.co. Optional CC recipients and webhooks receive submission data too. The plugin stores no submission records, adds no frontend scripts, and does not send messages until you run a configured form or press the test button. FormSubmit states that it retains submissions for 30 days. Update your privacy notice before collecting messages."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:167
msgid "Passwords, hidden fields and honeypots are excluded. Attachments are opt-in, use native Bricks Files fields, require Bricks 2.4.3+, and have a combined 10 MB limit. Bricks controls upload storage and cleanup. FormSubmit browser CAPTCHA and autoresponses are not available through AJAX; configure native Bricks spam protection and confirmation email if needed. Request acceptance does not guarantee inbox delivery. A timed-out request may already have reached the service; retrying could send a duplicate."
msgstr ""

